opennyai_summary.decision:
In the result the following;
ORDER
The appeal is allowed.
The order dated 29.04.2023 passed in Criminal Miscellaneous No. 721/2023 by the Additional District and Session Judge, FTSC-III, Bangalore Rural District Bangalore is set aside.
The bail petition filed by the appellant/accused stands allowed and the appellant/accused is ordered to be released on bail in NC: 2023:KHC:29291 Crime No.1/2023 of Devanahalli Police Station, subject to the following conditions;
a.
The appellant-accused shall execute a personal bond for a sum of Rs.1,00,000/-
(Rupees One Lakh only) with one surety for the likesum to the satisfaction of the Trial Court;
b. The appellant-accused shall not threaten the complainant or tamper other prosecution witnesses.
c. The appellant-accused shall appear before the trial Court on all dates of hearing unless exempted and cooperate for speedy disposal of the case.

